s{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/deployments","created_at":"2015-03-24T16:37:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T02:35:34Z","pushed_at":"2020-10-01T07:02:14Z","git_url":"git://github.com/rogual/neovim-dot-app.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:rogual/neovim-dot-app.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/rogual/neovim-dot-app.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/rogual/neovim-dot-app","homepage":"","size":873,"stargazers_count":1130,"watchers_count":1130,"language":"Objective-C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":62,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":65,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":62,"open_issues":65,"watchers":1130,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Referencing #212 and [210](https://github.com/rogual/neovim-dot-app/issues/210#issuecomment-184749487)\n\nMy localized `nvim --version` output is\n\n```\nNVIM v0.1.5-608-g8c1fb99\nBuild type: Release\nCompilation: [Removed for the sake of brevity]\n\nOptional features included (+) or not (-): +acl   +iconv    +jemalloc +tui      \nFor differences from Vim, see :help vim-differences\n\n          System-vimrc-Datei: \"$VIM/sysinit.vim\"\n     Voreinstellung für $VIM: \"\n/usr/local/Cellar/neovim/HEAD-8c1fb99/share/nvim\"\n```\n\nNote the line break after `Voreinstellung für $VIM: \"`\n\nThis causes [the makefile](https://github.com/rogual/neovim-dot-app/blob/a0a96204a827e482033b6ef6969de332a0859554/Makefile#L6) to fail with detecting the fallback VIM path.\n\nThis in turn causes the compilation to fail:\n\n```\n==> make NVIM=/usr/local/opt/neovim/bin/nvim\nLast 15 lines from /Users/pA/Library/Logs/Homebrew/neovim-dot-app/01.make:\n2016-07-20 11:01:12 +0200\n\nmake\nNVIM=/usr/local/opt/neovim/bin/nvim\n\nVIM= NVIM=/usr/local/opt/neovim/bin/nvim scons -Q\nPlease set VIM to Neovim's $VIM directory.\nmake: *** [all] Error 255\n```\n\nI do think that this is somewhat a bug in neovim (The line break makes little sense), but I wanted to give a heads up here nevertheless.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/issues/282/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rogual/neovim-dot-app/issues/282/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/234032251","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/5095#issuecomment-234032251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5095","id":234032251,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIzNDAzMjI1MQ==","user":{"login":"ZyX-I","id":322097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjA5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I","html_url":"https://github.com/ZyX-I","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-07-20T18:08:09Z","updated_at":"2016-07-20T18:11:02Z","body":"@PixelPirate \n1. It is real newline or just wrap?\n2. You should not be using localized paths, just set `LANG=C` before running Neovim.\n3. `export TMPFILE=\"$(mktmp)\" ; bash -c 'exec -c -a \"\" env -i TMPFILE=\"$TMPFILE\" nvim --cmd \"call writefile([\\$VIM, \\\"\\\"], \\$TMPFILE, \\\"b\\\")\" --cmd qall'` should get you fallback for $VIM in $TMPFILE.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/234032251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ZyX-I","id":322097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjA5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I","html_url